   2379  fe84							; RaftCellSolid — is the model row-2 (water row) playfield cell in display
   2380  fe84							; column A solid? Reflect mapping: CTRLPF $35 (reflect) is the cave default and
   2381  fe84							; a raft room has no door/bar band to switch it off. IN: A = display col 0..39.
